cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its certificates, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Log-concave entropy derivatives along the heat flow: certificates and counterexamples"
abstract: >-
  Computer-assisted research on the signs of higher time-derivatives of entropy along the heat
  flow for log-concave densities, S_m(p) = (-1)^m d^m/dt^m H(P_t p) at t = 0. Contains exact
  rational sum-of-squares certificates of nonnegativity at orders 6-11 and 13 (order 12 by
  heat-flow propagation), an Arb-certified log-concave counterexample at order 16, giving the
  bracket 14 <= m* <= 16 for the first failing order, and the certified threshold m_0 = 33 of the
  explicit family of Zou-Fan-Gao-Wang.
authors:
